 loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/c2f861af1d7089c2ceacb714e96d0744.poster.avif?t=1778836696\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/c2f861af1d7089c2ceacb714e96d0744.webm?t=1778836696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642600/extras/c2f861af1d7089c2ceacb714e96d0744.mp4?t=1778836696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 level of difficulties: Casual, Normal, and Expert Mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve High Score with the chain bonus</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards and achievements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
