                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A cool shmup, quite artistically unique. The trailer looks choppy and doesn't do it justice - the actual game is silky smooth. Even on a 4k 77 inch TV, everything looks crisp and detailed. Multiple parallax layers. You can combine multiple parts for your ship loadout (stuff like spread, charge laser, homing shot, etc.) and put together something that suits your style. Enemy bullets get lost in the background too much. It doesn't quite compete with the top games, but it's good enough and different enough to be worthwhile.",
